  "title": "习近平察看滇池生态湿地",
  "date": "2020-01-20 18:11:49",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王珂园                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n正在云南考察的习近平总书记20日来到昆明，并前往滇池星海半岛生态湿地，察看滇池保护治理情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/5/9654062395125444561.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/80/188160993778160900.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/10/4627815105725532434.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/58/14713083683848043682.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/75/8569610334706387815.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200120/89/10400566597079855829.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "正在云南考察的习近平总书记20日来到昆明，并前往滇池星海半岛生态湿地，察看滇池保护治理情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）"
  ]
